/// What a mod uses in [`Hooks::register`](crate::Hooks::register) to attach Parts and declare
/// block entity types, ticket controllers and config files. A thing takes one Part of each
/// kind: the same kind twice on one thing refuses the mods at startup, naming both.
///
/// Mods call the generic methods on `dyn Registrar` after requesting registry keys.
pub trait Registrar {}
/// Published capability metadata, default stock storage declarations, and place providers
/// exposed to lookups and game helpers; provider lists themselves are traversed directly from
/// the installed registry.
// hidden: a lookup's view of the registrar's table, not part of the mod surface
#[doc(hidden)]
pub trait CapabilityProviders {}
